  "scope": "One fresh local Kubernetes v1.36.1 Kind cluster. The case creates two distinct, case-owned OCI image layouts in a temporary directory from inert synthetic config and layer bytes; it computes each OCI image-manifest digest from the serialized manifest. A CycloneDX 1.6 fixture SBOM is generated from package metadata read out of each verified OCI layer, wrapped in an in-toto Statement v1 and signed with one ephemeral RSA key. A Kubernetes verifier Job independently verifies the DSSE signature and recomputes the supplied OCI manifest digest. One Job accepts the approved image's exact subject; another verifies a valid claim from the same signer for the second image and rejects its different subject against the approved digest. A disposable loopback TLS OCI registry stores the same two images and attaches only the approved image's exact signed statement. The case verifies discovery, digest-scoped retrieval, signature, and cleanup.",
